</span></span></p><p begin="3:17.514" end="3:19.720" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:17.514" end="3:17.614">And</span> <span begin="3:17.614" end="3:17.798">say</span> <span begin="3:17.798" end="3:17.942">the</span> <span begin="3:17.942" end="3:18.161">one</span> <span begin="3:18.234" end="3:18.512">thing</span> <span begin="3:18.823" end="3:19.006">I&apos;ve</span> <span begin="3:19.006" end="3:19.134">been</span> <span begin="3:19.134" end="3:19.491">want</span><span begin="3:19.491" end="3:19.720">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">说出我一直想听到的话</span></p><p begin="3:19.760" end="3:20.913" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:19.760" end="3:20.004">But</span> <span begin="3:20.032" end="3:20.913">no!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">可惜你没有</span></p></div><div begin="3:21.499" end="3:39.877" itunes:song-part="Outro"><p begin="3:21.499" end="3:30.546" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:25.719" end="3:26.024">Let&apos;s</span> <span begin="3:26.024" end="3:26.305">fast</span> <span begin="3:26.327" end="3:26.633">for</span><span begin="3:26.633" end="3:26.871">ward</span> <span begin="3:26.871" end="3:27.159">to</span> <span begin="3:27.229" end="3:27.522">3</span><span begin="3:27.522" end="3:28.046">00</span> <span begin="3:28.080" end="3:28.486">take</span><span begin="3:28.486" end="3:28.736">out</span> <span begin="3:28.736" end="3:29.028">cof</span><span begin="3:29.028" end="3:29.334">fees</span> <span begin="3:29.334" end="3:29.837">lat</span><span begin="3:29.837" end="3:30.546">er</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">快进到三百杯外卖咖啡之后</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="3:21.499" end="3:24.258"><span begin="3:21.499" end="3:21.845">(Flash</span><span begin="3:21.845" end="3:22.129">ing</span> <span begin="3:22.129" end="3:22.588">lights,</span> <span begin="3:23.635" end="3:23.943">oh</span> <span begin="3:23.943" end="3:24.258">Lord)</span><span ttm:role="x-transla